  "description": "A clumsy girl, Song Sena!\nAfter the most popular boy in her class lends her an umbrella, she ends up falling for him.\nBut every time she tries to confess, things just keep going wrong...!\nA confession that always almost happens, but never does!\n\n“Tomorrow, I’ll definitely tell him that I like him for real!”\n\nWill Sena’s feelings ever reach the most popular boy?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=819952), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10583445)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003509)",
